---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: stdout(&output)
---
Serves the built output

Usage: leptoskit serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dir <DIR>    The directory to serve; defaults to `dist/` [default: dist]
      --port <PORT>  Serve on a different port than the configuration says
  -h, --help         Print help
  -V, --version      Print version
